{"id":"en_the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen","title":"The Ember Serpent: Rise of the Mafia Queen","titleEn":"The Ember Serpent: Rise of the Mafia Queen","description":"Vincent, a mafia boss, discovers his daughter Seraphina living in the slums and names her as his successor. This decision fuels resentment in Annabelle, his adopted daughter. Teaming up with ambitious elders, Annabelle plots against Seraphina, laying lethal traps, orchestrating false accusations, and scheming to seize the inheritance. Seraphina endures harrowing ordeals that ultimately unlock her combat abilities. She is eventually reunited with Vincent and helps eliminate the traitors within the organization.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Finding Relatives","Karma Payback","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtjbk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtjbk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtjbk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtjbk/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ember-serpent-rise-of-the-mafia-que